{"id":1,"date":"2018-04-17T04:44:50","date_gmt":"2018-04-17T04:44:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.fm1.dev\/?page_id=2"},"modified":"2025-05-08T11:18:32","modified_gmt":"2025-05-08T15:18:32","slug":"home","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/","title":{"rendered":"Home"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-very-light-gray-background-color has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"640\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-104\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map-768x256.jpg 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map-1280x427.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-very-dark-gray-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\">Elevate Your Life with <br>Trusted Audiology Care<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Welcome to Elevate Audiology &#8211; Hearing &amp; Tinnitus Center<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Elevate and empower patients&#8217; lives by providing superior education, transparent treatment options, evidence-based hearing and tinnitus care, and an excellent patient experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/about-us\/\">Why Choose Us?<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/schedule\/\">Schedule Appointment<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Approach to Tinnitus<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The Elevate Audiology Approach to Tinnitus: <strong>There is hope,\u00a0there is help!<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>While many people experience tinnitus without significant disruption to their lives, for others it can be overwhelming and deeply affect daily functioning. At Elevate Audiology, we understand that every experience with tinnitus is unique\u2014and so is the care it requires.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our approach begins with truly getting to know you: your symptoms, your hearing history, the health of your auditory system and how tinnitus is impacting your life. From there, we work together\u2014as a team of experienced audiologists and an engaged, informed patient\u2014to build a personalized plan for relief.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We offer a full range of evidence-based options, including simple daily strategies, FDA-approved devices and exclusive access to a proprietary tinnitus app developed by Dr. Tarvin and her husband. You are not alone in this\u2014our team is here to guide and support you every step of the way.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/schedule\/\">Schedule your tinnitus appointment<\/a> today and take the first step toward clarity, calm and control.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/tinnitus\/\">Learn More<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-3-columns callouts is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Diagnostic Hearing Exam<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Following evidence-based care and best practices, we thoroughly evaluate your auditory system and explain the results to you and your family.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/hearing-loss\/\">Find Solutions<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Hearing Aids<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Variety of makes and models properly fit with real ear measurements and proper follow-up for patient success.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/hearing-aids\/\">View Our Models<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Earwax Removal&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">We safely remove earwax at our practice and you can even see inside your own ears!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/hearing-loss\/earwax-removal\/\">Learn More<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Tinnitus Assessment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For those with bothersome tinnitus, it can be beneficial to complete a tinnitus assessment in addition to the hearing evaluation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-499968f5 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/tinnitus\/tinnitus-evaluations\/\">Assess Level<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-3-columns callouts is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Tinnitus Management<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">While there is no \u201ccure\u201d to tinnitus, there are several successful management strategies to reduce the annoyance and perception of tinnitus. We work together to create your treatment plan.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/tinnitus\/tinnitus-management\/\">Find Solutions<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Evidence-Based Best Practice<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">We listen to the research and follow evidence-based practices to the best of our abilities to improve patient outcomes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/x-about-us\/evidence-based-practices\/\">Read More<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Repairs &amp; Maintenance<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">At Elevate Audiology, we will take care of you even if you did not originally purchase your current hearing aids from us!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/hearing-aids\/hearing-aid-repair-service\/\">Take Advantage<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Custom Hearing Protection &amp; Monitors<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Whether you need swim plugs for the pool, in-ear monitors for the stage, noise plugs for the plant, or custom pieces for your headphones, we make it all! Optional accessories are available.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-499968f5 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/hearing-loss\/hearing-protection\/\">View Our Options<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-cyan-bluish-gray-background-color has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"640\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-104\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map-768x256.jpg 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/map-1280x427.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"